# PDFs you drop into data/documents/ for local ingestion are often
# copyrighted (papers, manuals, etc.) — fine to use locally, not fine to
# publish into a public repo. The .txt documents we write ourselves stay
# tracked; PDFs don't.
data/documents/*.pdf
